WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,040
I have a pot and gas

2
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:03,440
Why do you have to do it outside? What are you afraid of when there is no electricity?

3
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:04,360
Just have gas

4
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:05,760
You can still burn wood when you run out of gas

5
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:07,280
What are you going to do with strong flavors in the future?

6
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:08,360
Can enter the space directly

7
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,880
You no longer have to worry about the fragrance wafting out

8
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:11,480
Forget it, I won’t do it

9
00:00:18,970 --> 00:00:20,610
That supermarket was already smoked

10
00:00:20,730 --> 00:00:22,050
Where are all these people going?

11
00:00:22,530 --> 00:00:23,570
They are going out again

12
00:00:23,850 --> 00:00:26,790
This government is opening a Bian Ning supermarket

13
00:00:26,790 --> 00:00:27,990
Food, biology, and wedding gifts are all available

14
00:00:27,990 --> 00:00:29,150
I heard that every district has one

15
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:32,030
If you don’t have anything to eat at home, you can buy it yourself. We’ll leave in a moment.

16
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:33,350
If you want to go together again, tell me as soon as possible

17
00:00:33,550 --> 00:00:35,070
Brother Hao, wait for me. I’ll go too.

18
00:00:35,070 --> 00:00:43,890
Okay, we'll meet downstairs in ten minutes. Sorry for the long wait.

19
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:45,930
I want to go to Binning Supermarket with you

20
00:00:45,930 --> 00:00:49,290
Can you give me a ride? I'll pay. Do you have the courage?

21
00:00:49,770 --> 00:00:52,290
OK, come on, two hundred bucks is no problem.
